{
  "apiVersion": "dashboard.grafana.app/v1",
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "kubernetes-health-reference"
  },
  "spec": {
    "__inputs": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "description": "Prometheus datasource containing Kubernetes telemetry",
        "type": "datasource",
        "pluginId": "prometheus",
        "pluginName": "Prometheus"
      }
    ],
    "annotations": {
      "list": [
        {
          "builtIn": 1,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana",
            "uid": "-- Grafana --"
          },
          "enable": true,
          "hide": true,
          "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
          "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
          "type": "dashboard"
        }
      ]
    },
    "description": "Generic Kubernetes health reference dashboard for cluster, control-plane, node, pod, and workload health. Requires k8s_cluster_name on queried series.",
    "editable": true,
    "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
    "graphTooltip": 1,
    "id": null,
    "links": [],
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 0,
        "type": "text",
        "title": "Requirements and scope",
        "description": "Metric assumptions and dependencies.",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 24,
          "h": 10
        },
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "### Assumptions\n- Every queried series carries the Prometheus label `k8s_cluster_name` (from the OpenTelemetry resource attribute `k8s.cluster.name`).\n- No application, environment, cloud, or tenant labels are required.\n\n### Metric dependencies\n- **kube-state-metrics:** glance, node, pod, and workload-health panels\n- **kube-apiserver scrape:** `up`, `kubernetes_build_info`, `apiserver_request_total`, and `apiserver_request_duration_seconds_bucket`\n- **etcd scrape:** leader, leader-change, WAL latency, and database-size metrics\n- **control-plane component scrapes:** optional scheduler and controller-manager `up` series\n\nMissing optional control-plane metrics leave their corresponding panels empty."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "type": "row",
        "title": "Kubernetes Health at a Glance",
        "description": "",
        "collapsed": false,
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 12,
          "w": 24,
          "h": 1
        },
        "panels": []
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Selected clusters",
        "description": "",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 13,
          "w": 4,
          "h": 5
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "count(group by (k8s_cluster_name) (kube_node_info{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"}))",
            "legendFormat": "Clusters",
            "instant": true,
            "range": false
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Node readiness",
        "description": "",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 4,
          "y": 13,
          "w": 4,
          "h": 5
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "sum(kube_node_status_condition{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",condition=\"Ready\",status=\"true\"} == 1) / clamp_min(count(kube_node_info{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"}),1)",
            "legendFormat": "Ready ratio",
            "instant": true,
            "range": false
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "red",
                  "value": null
                },
                {
                  "color": "yellow",
                  "value": 0.8
                },
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": 1
                }
              ]
            },
            "unit": "percentunit",
            "max": 1
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Not-ready nodes",
        "description": "",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 8,
          "y": 13,
          "w": 4,
          "h": 5
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "count(kube_node_status_condition{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",condition=\"Ready\",status=~\"false|unknown\"} == 1) or vector(0)",
            "legendFormat": "Nodes",
            "instant": true,
            "range": false
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                },
                {
                  "color": "yellow",
                  "value": 1
                },
                {
                  "color": "red",
                  "value": 3
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Unschedulable nodes",
        "description": "",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 12,
          "y": 13,
          "w": 4,
          "h": 5
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "sum(kube_node_spec_unschedulable{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"} == 1) or vector(0)",
            "legendFormat": "Nodes",
            "instant": true,
            "range": false
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                },
                {
                  "color": "yellow",
                  "value": 1
                },
                {
                  "color": "red",
                  "value": 3
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Unavailable workload pods",
        "description": "Sum of unavailable Deployment replicas, unready StatefulSet replicas, and unavailable DaemonSet pods.",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 16,
          "y": 13,
          "w": 4,
          "h": 5
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "(sum(kube_deployment_spec_replicas{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"} - kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"}) or vector(0)) + (sum(kube_statefulset_replicas{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"} - kube_statefulset_status_replicas_ready{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"}) or vector(0)) + (sum(kube_daemonset_status_number_unavailable{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"}) or vector(0))",
            "legendFormat": "Pods",
            "instant": true,
            "range": false
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                },
                {
                  "color": "yellow",
                  "value": 1
                },
                {
                  "color": "red",
                  "value": 3
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Failed pods",
        "description": "",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 20,
          "y": 13,
          "w": 4,
          "h": 5
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "count(kube_pod_status_phase{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",phase=\"Failed\"} == 1) or vector(0)",
            "legendFormat": "Pods",
            "instant": true,
            "range": false
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                },
                {
                  "color": "yellow",
                  "value": 1
                },
                {
                  "color": "red",
                  "value": 3
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "type": "row",
        "title": "Kubernetes Control Plane",
        "description": "Requires direct scrapes of Kubernetes control-plane components; managed services may not expose every metric.",
        "collapsed": false,
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 18,
          "w": 24,
          "h": 1
        },
        "panels": []
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "API server availability",
        "description": "1 means the API-server scrape target is reachable.",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 19,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 8
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "up{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",job=~\".*apiserver.*\"}",
            "legendFormat": "{{k8s_cluster_name}} / {{instance}}",
            "instant": false,
            "range": true
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                }
              ]
            },
            "unit": "bool",
            "max": 1
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "showLegend": true,
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull",
              "max"
            ]
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "API server 5xx and 429 rate",
        "description": "Server errors and throttled requests per second.",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 12,
          "y": 19,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 8
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "sum by (k8s_cluster_name,code) (rate(apiserver_request_total{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",code=~\"5..|429\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
            "legendFormat": "{{k8s_cluster_name}} / HTTP {{code}}",
            "instant": false,
            "range": true
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                }
              ]
            },
            "unit": "ops"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "showLegend": true,
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull",
              "max"
            ]
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "API server request latency \u2014 p99",
        "description": "WATCH requests excluded because their duration reflects connection lifetime.",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 27,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 8
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (k8s_cluster_name,verb,le) (rate(apiserver_request_duration_seconds_bucket{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",verb!=\"WATCH\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
            "legendFormat": "{{k8s_cluster_name}} / {{verb}}",
            "instant": false,
            "range": true
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                }
              ]
            },
            "unit": "s"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "showLegend": true,
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull",
              "max"
            ]
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Control-plane component availability",
        "description": "",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 12,
          "y": 27,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 8
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "max by (k8s_cluster_name,job) (up{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",job=~\".*(scheduler|controller-manager).*\"})",
            "legendFormat": "{{k8s_cluster_name}} / {{job}}",
            "instant": false,
            "range": true
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                }
              ]
            },
            "unit": "bool",
            "max": 1
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "showLegend": true,
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull",
              "max"
            ]
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "etcd leader health",
        "description": "Each member should report 1.",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 35,
          "w": 8,
          "h": 8
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "etcd_server_has_leader{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"}",
            "legendFormat": "{{k8s_cluster_name}} / {{instance}}",
            "instant": false,
            "range": true
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                }
              ]
            },
            "unit": "bool",
            "max": 1
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "showLegend": true,
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull",
              "max"
            ]
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "etcd leader changes / min",
        "description": "",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 8,
          "y": 35,
          "w": 8,
          "h": 8
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "sum by (k8s_cluster_name,instance) (rate(etcd_server_leader_changes_seen_total{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
            "legendFormat": "{{k8s_cluster_name}} / {{instance}}",
            "instant": false,
            "range": true
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                }
              ]
            },
            "unit": "opm"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "showLegend": true,
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull",
              "max"
            ]
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "etcd WAL fsync latency \u2014 p99",
        "description": "",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 16,
          "y": 35,
          "w": 8,
          "h": 8
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (k8s_cluster_name,instance,le) (rate(etcd_disk_wal_fsync_duration_seconds_bucket{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
            "legendFormat": "{{k8s_cluster_name}} / {{instance}}",
            "instant": false,
            "range": true
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                }
              ]
            },
            "unit": "s"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "showLegend": true,
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull",
              "max"
            ]
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "type": "row",
        "title": "Node Health",
        "description": "Requires kube-state-metrics.",
        "collapsed": false,
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 43,
          "w": 24,
          "h": 1
        },
        "panels": []
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Ready node count",
        "description": "",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 44,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 8
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "sum by (k8s_cluster_name) (kube_node_status_condition{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",condition=\"Ready\",status=\"true\"} == 1)",
            "legendFormat": "{{k8s_cluster_name}}",
            "instant": false,
            "range": true
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                }
              ]
            },
            "unit": "short"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "showLegend": true,
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull",
              "max"
            ]
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Node pressure conditions",
        "description": "",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 12,
          "y": 44,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 8
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "sum by (k8s_cluster_name,node,condition) (kube_node_status_condition{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",condition=~\"MemoryPressure|DiskPressure|PIDPressure|NetworkUnavailable\",status=\"true\"} == 1)",
            "legendFormat": "{{k8s_cluster_name}} / {{node}} / {{condition}}",
            "instant": false,
            "range": true
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                }
              ]
            },
            "unit": "short"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "showLegend": true,
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull",
              "max"
            ]
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "type": "table",
        "title": "Node inventory",
        "description": "Kubelet version, object age, and readiness by node.",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 52,
